    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We make all books in the *Systems Approach* series available as both print and e-books.",
      "source_hash": 6821016694640150866,
      "context_hash": 4160552514779992496,
      "translation": "*Systems Approach* 시리즈의 모든 책은 인쇄본과 전자책으로 모두 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-23T21:39:21.409430Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This book is not yet in print; the 6th edition is available via `bookstores  <https://systemsapproach.org/books/>`__ including Amazon: `Computer Networks: A Systems Approach <https://amzn.to/3CtG81U>`__",
      "source_hash": 14237168982960835456,
      "context_hash": 5570378524440070817,
      "translation": "이 책은 아직 인쇄본으로 출간되지 않았습니다. 6판은 Amazon을 비롯한 `서점 <https://systemsapproach.org/books/>`__\\ 에서 구입할 수 있습니다: `Computer Networks: A Systems Approach <https://amzn.to/3CtG81U>`__",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-23T21:39:21.409430Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
